@lang en

-- us-nouns.l4 : the nouns of Title 1 of the United States Code (General Provisions), and nothing else.
-- DECLARE only: no rules, no directives. Every other module of this row except us-interpretation-time.l4
-- (which must be self-contained and keeps its own few types) imports this one.
-- Membership test: could a witness of ordinary competence testify to the fact, or does answering it
-- need the text of Title 1? Only the first kind is here. "The child breathes" is here; "the child was born
-- alive within section 8(b)" is a rule and is not.

-- Chapter 1, section 1 ("Words denoting number, gender, and so forth")
DECLARE `Kind of body` IS ONE OF
    `an individual`
    `a corporation`
    `a company`
    `an association`
    `a firm`
    `a partnership`
    `a society`
    `a joint stock company`
    `a body of some other kind`

DECLARE `Way of reproducing a writing` IS ONE OF
    `printing`
    `typewriting`
    `photographing`
    `multigraphing`
    `mimeographing`
    `manifolding`
    `some other way of reproducing visual symbols`
    `a way that does not reproduce visual symbols`

-- Section 2
DECLARE `A subdivision` HAS
    `it is a subdivision of a State or Territory of the United States` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is a parish`                                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is another equivalent subdivision`                             IS A BOOLEAN

-- Section 3, "vessel"
DECLARE `A watercraft or other contrivance` HAS
    `it is a watercraft`                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is another artificial contrivance`                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is used as a means of transportation on water`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is capable of being used as a means of transportation on water`     IS A BOOLEAN

-- Section 4, "vehicle"
DECLARE `A carriage or other contrivance` HAS
    `it is a carriage`                                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is another artificial contrivance`                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is used as a means of transportation on land`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is capable of being used as a means of transportation on land`      IS A BOOLEAN

-- Section 6
DECLARE `A fish product` HAS
    `it is a fresh or frozen fish fillet`                                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is a fresh or frozen fish steak`                                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is a fresh or frozen slice of fish`                                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is substantially free of bone`                                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `it was produced in a foreign country or its territorial waters`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `some of the labor used to produce it was that of persons who are not residents of the United States` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Section 7
DECLARE `A place` IS ONE OF
    `a State of the Union`
    `the District of Columbia`
    `the Commonwealth of Puerto Rico`
    `another territory or possession of the United States`
    `a place outside any State`

DECLARE `A marriage` HAS
    `the number of individuals who are parties to it`               IS A NUMBER
    `where it was entered into`                                      IS A `A place`
    `it is valid under the law applicable when it was entered into` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it could have been entered into in a State`                     IS A BOOLEAN

-- Section 8
DECLARE `Way of birth` IS ONE OF
    `natural labor`
    `induced labor`
    `cesarean section`
    `induced abortion`
    `some other way`

DECLARE `A birth` HAS
    `there was complete expulsion or extraction from the mother`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `afterwards it breathes`                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `afterwards it has a beating heart`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `afterwards it has pulsation of the umbilical cord`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `afterwards it has definite movement of voluntary muscles`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the umbilical cord has been cut`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the way of birth`                                                  IS A `Way of birth`

-- Chapter 2, sections 103 and 104: the sections of an Act or resolution
DECLARE `A section of an Act` HAS
    `its number as printed`                       IS A NUMBER
    `it carries a number`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `it uses enacting or resolving words`         IS A BOOLEAN

-- Chapter 2, sections 112, 112a, 113, 204 and 209: what is published, what is offered as proof, and where
DECLARE `A publication` IS ONE OF
    `the United States Statutes at Large`
    `United States Treaties and Other International Agreements`
    `the Little and Brown edition of the laws and treaties`
    `a slip or pamphlet law issued under the authority of the Archivist`
    `the Treaties and Other International Acts Series`
    `the Code of Laws of the United States`
    `the Code of the District of Columbia`
    `a publication of some other kind`

DECLARE `A matter to be proved` IS ONE OF
    `a public Act of Congress`
    `a private Act of Congress`
    `a concurrent resolution`
    `a treaty`
    `an international agreement other than a treaty`
    `a proclamation by the President of a treaty or of an international agreement other than a treaty`
    `a proclamation by the President of some other kind`
    `a proposed or ratified amendment to the Constitution of the United States`
    `a law of the United States, general and permanent in its nature`
    `a law relating to or in force in the District of Columbia, general and permanent in its nature`
    `a matter of some other kind`

DECLARE `A forum` IS ONE OF
    `a court of the United States`
    `a court of a State`
    `a court of a Territory or insular possession of the United States`
    `a court of the District of Columbia`
    `a tribunal or public office of the United States`
    `a tribunal or public office of a State`
    `a tribunal or public office of a Territory or insular possession of the United States`
    `a tribunal or public office of the District of Columbia`
    `a forum of some other kind`

-- Section 209
DECLARE `A printed copy` HAS
    `it is a copy of the Code of Laws relating to the District of Columbia`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is a copy of a supplement provided for by section 202 or section 203`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `it was printed at the Government Publishing Office`                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `it bears the imprint of the Government Publishing Office`                                IS A BOOLEAN

-- Chapter 2, section 112b: an instrument that is or may be exempt from posting (subsection (b)(3))
DECLARE `An instrument under section 112b` HAS
    `it contains information given a national security classification or otherwise exempt from public disclosure` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it addresses military operations, military exercises, acquisition and cross servicing, logistics support, military personnel exchange or education programs, or reciprocal health care to military personnel` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it establishes the terms of grant or similar assistance financed with foreign assistance funds under the Foreign Assistance Act of 1961 or the Food for Peace Act` IS A BOOLEAN
    `its principal function is to establish technical details for a specific project under another instrument already published under section 112b` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it has been separately published by a depositary or other similar administrative body` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Chapter 2, section 112b(k)(5): a non-binding instrument, and whether it is a "qualifying non-binding instrument"
DECLARE `A non-binding instrument` HAS
    `it is or will be under negotiation, is signed or becomes operative, or is implemented with foreign governments, international organizations or foreign entities, including non-state actors` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it could reasonably be expected to have a significant impact on the foreign policy of the United States` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is the subject of a written communication from the Chair or Ranking Member of either appropriate congressional committee to the Secretary` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it is signed, becomes operative or is implemented under the authorities relied upon by the Department of Defense, the Armed Forces or an element of the intelligence community` IS A BOOLEAN
